From: lishuangfan13-afk <lishuangfan13@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] ai_agent: support screen-free external command submissions

Add --headless to leave NSH input to the product frontend. Reject messages
before initialization or during shutdown, preserve rejected message ownership,
and wait for active queue operations before teardown. Headless mode leaves
background heartbeat disabled; user-created cron reminders remain enabled.
The Zhaoxi profile installs and advertises only note-taker and reminder skills.
No provider is changed.
Based on packages_ai_agent e65550f18759f086d7f544edcf17d1e31223244f.

